      "data_quality_notes": "Prior year development (gross) was calculated from the gross claims development triangle (columns 2011-2013) which produced a net gross deterioration of +GBP 10.4m. The narrative discloses a small net improvement of GBP 0.2m within net claims incurred (net of reinsurance) which was not used as the primary gross PYD source. Some LOB mappings (e.g. Political Risk -> Reinsurance - Specialty; Consumer Products -> Accident & Health) are approximate because the report uses non-standard class names; amounts by LOB for PYD are not separately quantified in the report. Reinsurance to close activity is described elsewhere in the report (closure of 2010/2011 into 2014) but the gross claims development table was used as the primary source; RITC distortions were considered and the triangle columns used exclude the most recent two years.",
